OL,3,GNEWSAArtists 'let down and left behind'
OL,4,Aas funding reaches 'crisis point'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepresentatives from the arts sector
OL,7,Fsaid they feel "let down and left
OL,8,Fbehind", warning that arts funding has
OL,9,F"reached a crisis point".
OL,11,FMembers of a performing arts trade
OL,12,Funion have signed a letter of no
OL,13,Fconfidence over what they believe is a
OL,14,F"failure" of Communities Minister
OL,15,FGordon Lyons to produce an arts policy
OL,16,Fand the under investments in the arts
OL,17,Facross Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
