OL,3,GNEWSAArtists 'let down and left behind'
OL,4,Aas funding reaches 'crisis point'
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor, writer and comedian Alan McKee
OL,7,Fwas one of those who signed the letter
OL,8,Fand said "we have no confidence at the
OL,9,Fmoment in how the minister is doing his
OL,10,Fjob".
OL,12,FThe communities minister said the
OL,13,Fexecutive is in "a really tight
OL,14,Fchallenging financial environment".
